# CODEOWNERS — review routing for the DOD iOS app.
#
# Soft enforcement: branch protection isn't enabled on this private repo
# (would require GitHub Pro), so CODEOWNERS just auto-requests reviews —
# it doesn't block merge. Treat the request as a social contract: get
# one human review from the *other* maintainer before merging.

# Default: both maintainers own everything.
*                                       @adamsned @spencer0706

# Spec, constitution, and clarifications are higher-risk — call them out
# explicitly so they're visible in the PR review request list.
/specs/                                 @adamsned @spencer0706
/Marketing/                             @adamsned @spencer0706

# CI + repo plumbing.
/.github/                               @adamsned
/scripts/                               @adamsned

# Signing, entitlements, secrets surfaces — bias to the repo admin.
/App/DODApp.xcconfig*                   @adamsned
/App/*.entitlements                     @adamsned
/Marketing/AppPrivacy.md                @adamsned
